// HB21's STOCK-SCRIPT OVERRIDE, vendored (map 1 red-team 2026-07-10): the pack
// replaces share/raw/.../animation_state_machine_utility.gsc with a 617-byte
// version that IMPLEMENTS RequestState/SearchAnimationMap (stock ships them as
// no-ops). The PANZER already depends on it, but nothing in this repo carried
// it — so a Mod Tools "verify" would revert the install copy and silently break
// the Panzer AND the Reaver. Vendored at the stock path = the usermap copy wins
// at compile, which closes that single point of failure for both.
scriptparsetree,scripts/shared/ai/systems/animation_state_machine_utility.gsc
