// --- HELLHOUNDS (elite #3, unlocked by the LAP 30 breather door) ------------
// PURE STOCK, ZERO EXTERNAL PACK. zm_factory_zombie_dog is the last complete
// unused behaviour tree on this machine. The WHOLE asset chain rides in
// transitively on the aitype line — character, xmodel + LODs, materials,
// images, melee weapon, footstep table, the .ai_am/.ai_ast/.ai_asm/.ai_bt and
// every dog xanim. Proven twice: map 1's packed assetlist carries the same
// chain, and this map's other boss aitypes already pull transitive characters
// with no .map spawner behind them.
// NO fx lines: all four dog FX are inherited via zm_common/zm_levelcommon and
// #precached by stock _zm_ai_dogs, which is already in this build.
// NO .map spawner entity: the .map is generated and boss aitypes get a bare
// SpawnActor. SpawnActor resolves the spawner_ form; archetype_ is its parent
// and is listed belt-and-braces, matching the zod/protector block.
aitype,spawner_zm_factory_zombie_dog
aitype,archetype_zm_factory_zombie_dog
